WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.138
Every Monday morning is show-and-tell time in Mr. Francesco's class.

2
00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:17.700
Each week, five students bring something to class.

3
00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:22.376
They show and tell their classmates all about it.

4
00:00:22.377 --> 00:00:24.411
Brandy's turn was next week.

5
00:00:24.412 --> 00:00:31.008
She was very worried because she didn't know what to show.

6
00:00:31.009 --> 00:00:33.043
Brandy didn't have any pets.

7
00:00:33.044 --> 00:00:35.335
She didn't have any hobbies.

8
00:00:35.336 --> 00:00:37.865
Brandy thought and thought.

9
00:00:37.866 --> 00:00:41.097
What could she bring for show-and-tell?

10
00:00:41.098 --> 00:00:43.972
Last week, Kara brought her pet iguana.

11
00:00:43.973 --> 00:00:49.725
The week before, Miyuki performed a magic trick.

12
00:00:49.726 --> 00:00:52.649
It was already Friday afternoon.

13
00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:56.386
Brandy still didn't know what she was going to do for show-and-tell.

14
00:00:56.387 --> 00:01:02.036
"Is something wrong, Brandy?" asked her mother.

15
00:01:02.037 --> 00:01:08.580
"Mom, what should I do for show-and-tell on Monday?" asked Brandy.

16
00:01:08.581 --> 00:01:11.700
"There are many things you are good at."

17
00:01:11.701 --> 00:01:15.712
"Like what?" asked Brandy.

18
00:01:15.713 --> 00:01:21.141
"Well, you're good at math, and . . . " her mother paused.

19
00:01:21.142 --> 00:01:26.056
"Oh, honey, can you get that jar for me?"

20
00:01:26.057 --> 00:01:28.944
Brandy was always ready to help her mother.

21
00:01:28.945 --> 00:01:33.366
Three years ago, Brandy's mother was in a terrible car accident.

22
00:01:33.367 --> 00:01:37.757
She could no longer use her legs.

23
00:01:37.758 --> 00:01:40.662
The weekend passed and soon it was Monday morning.

24
00:01:40.663 --> 00:01:43.087
It was time for show-and-tell.

25
00:01:43.088 --> 00:01:45.722
"Okay, now it's Brandy's turn.

26
00:01:45.723 --> 00:01:51.195
What are you going to share with us?" asked the teacher.

27
00:01:51.196 --> 00:01:58.259
"I . . . I'm sorry, Mr. Francesco," Brandy said quietly.

28
00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:03.136
"Sorry I'm late!" Just then, Brandy's mother arrived.

29
00:02:03.137 --> 00:02:08.593
"Hello, everyone!" she said to the class.

30
00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:10.498
"I'm Brandy's mother.

31
00:02:10.499 --> 00:02:18.532
I know it's Brandy's turn for show-and-tell, but I wanted to show and tell you something about my daughter.

32
00:02:18.533 --> 00:02:21.418
Brandy is very important to me.

33
00:02:21.419 --> 00:02:26.807
Without her, I could not get my work done as quickly.

34
00:02:26.808 --> 00:02:32.223
Since my accident, sometimes Brandy has to be my arms.

35
00:02:32.224 --> 00:02:35.436
Sometimes Brandy has to be my legs.

36
00:02:35.437 --> 00:02:44.923
It's not easy being in a wheelchair, but my life is much easier because I have my daughter to help me."

37
00:02:44.924 --> 00:02:49.150
"That was one of the best show-and-tell times we have ever had!

38
00:02:49.151 --> 00:02:50.769
Thank you, Mrs. Lewis.

39
00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:57.326
Thank you, Brandy," said Mr. Francesco.

40
00:02:57.327 --> 00:03:00.909
Brandy does not mind being her mother's arms and legs.

41
00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:08.773
Her mother is a very important person in her life, and Brandy loves her.
